co_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-1d0492f53df80cf1END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-0edd755953c53c5fEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_TheLodge_EggContract</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_TheLodge_EggContract\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_TheLodge_EggContract\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">78016091-632f-42eb-81bd-f7223da8ee5a</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:78016091-632f-42eb-81bd-f7223da8ee5a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:78016091-632f-42eb-81bd-f7223da8ee5a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Esther\" title=\"Esther\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/25px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/38px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/50px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lady Esther\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/25px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Esther\" title=\"Esther\">Lady Esther</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery_Trail\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery Trail\">Rosymorn Monastery Trail</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-44&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-129</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Call for Adventurers: Exploring the Nature versus Nurture Debate The Society of Brilliance is pleased to announce an open call for adventurers to participate in a groundbreaking research project examining the intriguing and enduring question of nature vs nurture. The aim of this project is to investigate the relative contributions of nature and nurture in determining characteristics, traits, and outcomes.\n</p><p><br>\nOur hypothesis: A githyanki raised in a peaceful, nurturing environment, will rise above its inherent nature to become a productive and progressive member of society.\n</p><p><br>\nYour contribution: We require one githyanki egg, unhatched and in good condition, taken directly from a githyanki crèche.\n</p><p><br>\nGenerous payment will be provided on successful completion of the task.\n</p><p><br>\nPlease contact <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Havkelaag\" title=\"Havkelaag\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Havkelaag.png/25px-Portrait_Havkelaag.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Havkelaag.png/38px-Portrait_Havkelaag.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Havkelaag.png/50px-Portrait_Havkelaag.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Havkelaag\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Havkelaag.png/25px-Portrait_Havkelaag.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Portrait_Havkelaag.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Havkelaag\" title=\"Havkelaag\">Havkelaag</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Lodge\" title=\"The Lodge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Lodge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/The_Lodge\" title=\"The Lodge\">The Lodge</a> for further details.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Correspondence_from_Lady_Esther\" title=\"Correspondence from Lady Esther\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Correspondence_from_Lady_Esther\" title=\"Correspondence from Lady Esther\">Correspondence from Lady Esther</a></span>.\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202709\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.085 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3039/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47493/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15884/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1104065/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   70.911      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   70.911      1 -total\n 43.80%   31.058     10 Template:Icon_text\n 41.74%   29.600     35 Template:Trim\n 31.91%   22.629      1 Template:PageSeo\n 31.81%   22.559      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 24.92%   17.672      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 21.83%   15.483      2 Template:Item_icon\n 14.57%   10.331      5 Template:Icon_link\n 14.39%   10.203      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:13978-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202709 and revision id 296902. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}